###Combine

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}\goldE{5}+\goldE{3}+9\blueE{t}
\\\\
&=\goldE{8}+9\blueE{t}
\end{align}$

We cannot combine $\goldE{8}+9\blueE{t}$ since they aren't like terms.
